OBJ_Z=r'固定有限总体 $N$、输入 $x$、输入基线向量 $r$、实值模型 $v$；$x_S$ 保留 $S$ 中坐标，其他设为 $r$。规范游戏 $g(S)=v(x_S)$，输出基线标量 $b=g(\varnothing)$，$g_0(S)=g(S)-b$。原文 $b_i$ 或 $r_i$ 是输入基线，原文 $U,w,J,C,\pi$ 的局部作用域由本条定义明确；不把 $b$ 默认成零。'
OBJ_E=r'Fix a finite universe $N$, input $x$, input baseline vector $r$, and real-valued model $v$. The mask $x_S$ retains coordinates in $S$ and replaces the others by $r$. The canonical game is $g(S)=v(x_S)$, its scalar output baseline is $b=g(\varnothing)$, and $g_0(S)=g(S)-b$. Source $b_i$ or $r_i$ denotes the input baseline; local $U,w,J,C,\pi$ retain the scopes defined in this entry. The scalar $b$ is not assumed zero.'
# entry -> (English title, original statement TeX, source proof key, source explanation, rewritten zh, rewritten en, role)
D={}
def row(i,en,tex,z,e,key=None,role='complete_proof',source=None):D[i]=(en,tex,key,source,z,e,role)
INV=['proof-finite-mobius-reconstruction-v2','proof-finite-mobius-uniqueness-v2']
row('dyn-universal','Theorem 2: exact AND/OR matching',r'v(\hat x_S)=v(\hat x_\varnothing)+\sum_{\varnothing\ne T\subseteq S}I_{and}(T\mid\hat x)+\sum_{T\cap S\ne\varnothing}I_{or}(T\mid\hat x)',
r'''固定论文分解 $a(S)=v_{and}(x_S),o(S)=v_{or}(x_S)$，$a+o=g$，$a(\varnothing)=b,o(\varnothing)=0$。Möbius 反演给 $a(S)=\sum_{T\subseteq S}I_a(T)=b+\sum_{\varnothing\ne T\subseteq S}I_a(T)$，空项只计一次。\n\n令 $h(L)=o(N\setminus L)$。非空 OR 系数为 $O(T)=-I_h(T)$。全部非空 OR 和等于 $h(\varnothing)-h(N)=o(N)-o(\varnothing)$；不激活 $S$ 的 OR 和等于 $h(\varnothing)-h(N\setminus S)=o(N)-o(S)$。相减得激活和为 $o(S)-o(\varnothing)=o(S)$；最后加 AND 得同一原定理。原 F.1 第二 OR 分组未正确排除空交集，使用全和减去不激活和补正证明。''',
r'''Fix the source split $a(S)=v_{and}(x_S),o(S)=v_{or}(x_S)$ with $a+o=g$, $a(\varnothing)=b,o(\varnothing)=0$. Möbius inversion gives $a(S)=\sum_{T\subseteq S}I_a(T)=b+\sum_{\varnothing\ne T\subseteq S}I_a(T)$, counting the empty term once.\n\nPut $h(L)=o(N\setminus L)$. Nonempty OR coefficients are $O(T)=-I_h(T)$. Their full sum is $o(N)-o(\varnothing)$, while the sum inactive on $S$ is $o(N)-o(S)$. Subtract to obtain $o(S)-o(\varnothing)=o(S)$ and add the AND component. The second OR grouping in F.1 does not correctly exclude disjoint activations; the full-minus-inactive proof repairs the same theorem.''',key='dyn-universal')
row('dyn-taylor','Lemma 3: support-grouped Taylor interaction',r'I(T\mid x)=\sum_{\pi\in Q_T}\frac{1}{\prod_i\pi_i!}\left.\partial^\pi v\right|_{x=x_\varnothing}\prod_{i\in T}(x_i-b_i)^{\pi_i}',
r'''原文对 DNN 和输入不限制解析性，直接使用全局 Taylor 等式。反例取一变量 ReLU 网络 $v(t)=\max(t-1/2,0)$、输入基线 $r=0$、$x=1$。它在基线邻域恒为零，所以全部阶导数在 $0$ 为零；Taylor 右端为零，而 $I(\{1\})=v(1)-v(0)=1/2$。这否定原无条件陈述，不能靠新增解析性修复命题。\n\n有效有限多项式子结果独立保留：每个单项式的支持为 $A$，被遮罩坐标的正次数使其消失，故 $m_A(x_S)=\mathbf1_{A\subseteq S}m_A(x)$。按支持分组的系数重构全部掩码输出，唯一性使其等于真实交互。此子结果并非任意 DNN 的 Taylor 命题。''',
r'''The source imposes no analyticity restriction on the DNN or input and uses a global Taylor equality. Take the one-variable ReLU network $v(t)=\max(t-1/2,0)$, baseline $r=0$, and $x=1$. The network vanishes near the baseline, so all derivatives at $0$ vanish. Its Taylor right side is zero whereas $I(\{1\})=v(1)-v(0)=1/2$. This refutes the unrestricted statement; adding analyticity would change it.\n\nA separate valid finite-polynomial result remains: a monomial of support $A$ obeys $m_A(x_S)=\mathbf1_{A\subseteq S}m_A(x)$ because masked positive-degree coordinates annihilate it. Grouping by support reconstructs every mask, and uniqueness identifies those coefficients with actual dividends. This does not prove the unrestricted Taylor claim.''',key='dyn-taylor',role='counterexample')
row('dyn-trigger-representation','Equations (6) and (7): normalized triggers',r'f(x)=\sum_{T\subseteq N}w_TJ_T(x),\quad J_T(x)=\sum_{\pi\in Q_T}\frac{\partial^\pi v(x_\varnothing)}{\prod_i\pi_i!}\frac{\prod_{i\in T}(x_i-b_i)^{\pi_i}}{w_T},\quad w_T=I(T\mid\hat x)',
r'''原 Eq.(27) 约去 $w_T$ 只有在 $w_T\ne0$ 且 Taylor 展开有效时才能成立；原设定允许恒定网络，所有非空 $w_T=0$，原 $J_T$ 于是含 $0/0$。这是原表达的定义域问题，不能给零系数偷偷规定为二值触发。\n\n在原表达有定义的范围，若支持项分子记作 $K_T$，遮罩律给 $K_T(\hat x_S)=\mathbf1_{T\subseteq S}K_T(\hat x)$，且 $K_T(\hat x)=w_T$；非零归一化给 $J_T(\hat x_S)=\mathbf1_{T\subseteq S}$。于是 $f(\hat x_S)=\sum_{T\subseteq S}w_T=v(\hat x_S)$，基线使用 $w_\varnothing=b,J_\varnothing=1$。有限二值模型可以独立定义，但它不能修复原零分母 Taylor 定义。''',
r'''The cancellation in Eq.(27) requires both $w_T\ne0$ and a valid Taylor expansion. A constant network is allowed and has every nonempty $w_T=0$, making the printed $J_T$ contain $0/0$. This is a domain issue, and a binary value cannot be silently assigned to zero coefficients.\n\nWhere the printed expression is defined, write its numerator as $K_T$. The support mask identity gives $K_T(\hat x_S)=\mathbf1_{T\subseteq S}K_T(\hat x)$ and $K_T(\hat x)=w_T$. Nonzero normalization yields the binary trigger. Consequently $f(\hat x_S)=\sum_{T\subseteq S}w_T=v(\hat x_S)$, with $w_\varnothing=b,J_\varnothing=1$. An independently defined binary model does not repair the zero denominator in the source Taylor definition.''',key='dyn-trigger-representation',role='partial_proof')
row('dyn-noisy-output','Lemma 1: noisy dividend variance',r'\widetilde I(T\mid x)=I(T\mid x)+\Delta I_T,\quad E[\Delta I_T]=0,\quad\operatorname{Var}[\Delta I_T]=2^{|T|}\sigma^2,\quad\epsilon_T=\Delta I_T/w_T',
r'''交互线性性无条件给 $\Delta I_T=\sum_{L\subseteq T}(-1)^{|T|-|L|}\Delta v_L$。有限期望线性性给均值为零，边缘分布已足够。\n\n原正文仅规定各 $\Delta v_L\sim\mathcal N(0,\sigma^2)$；取一变量且两个遮罩共用同一个 $Z\sim\mathcal N(0,\sigma^2)$，$\Delta v_\varnothing=\Delta v_{\{1\}}=Z$。所有原边缘条件满足，而 $\Delta I_{\{1\}}=Z-Z=0$，方差为零，非原 $2\sigma^2$（$\sigma>0$）。附录 F.3 新增 iid 才能消掉协方差。\n\n独立模型下的真概率证明另列：每个符号平方为 $1$，方差有限和为 $\sum_{L\subseteq T}\sigma^2=2^{|T|}\sigma^2$。若 $w_T\ne0$，标准缩放给触发噪声方差 $2^{|T|}\sigma^2/w_T^2$，不同 $T$ 的比例常数不同；主文 Assumption 1 是另设模型，不能由此自动推出。''',
r'''Linearity gives $\Delta I_T=\sum_{L\subseteq T}(-1)^{|T|-|L|}\Delta v_L$ without independence. Finite expectation linearity gives zero mean from the marginal laws.\n\nThe main statement specifies only Gaussian marginals. For one variable use the same $Z\sim\mathcal N(0,\sigma^2)$ for both masks. All stated marginal conditions hold, but $\Delta I_{\{1\}}=Z-Z=0$ has variance zero rather than $2\sigma^2$ when $\sigma>0$. F.3 adds iid noise to eliminate covariance.\n\nThe separate independent model has a real probability proof: every sign has square one, so the variance is $\sum_{L\subseteq T}\sigma^2=2^{|T|}\sigma^2$. For $w_T\ne0$, scaling gives trigger variance $2^{|T|}\sigma^2/w_T^2$; its proportionality factor depends on $T$. Assumption 1 introduces another model and does not follow automatically.''',key='dyn-noisy-output',role='counterexample')
row('dyn-regression','Theorem 3: unique noisy least-squares optimum',r'\hat w=(J^\top J+2^n\operatorname{diag}(c))^{-1}J^\top y=(J^\top J+2^n\operatorname{diag}(c))^{-1}J^\top Jw^*',
r'''在论文 Assumption 1 的独立零均值、方差 $c_T=2^{|T|}\sigma^2$ 模型中，对每个遮罩展开平方。交叉期望为零且 $E[(\sum_Tw_T\epsilon_T)^2]=\sum_Tc_Tw_T^2$，因此精确有 $2^n\widetilde L(w)=\|y-Jw\|^2+2^n\sum_Tc_Tw_T^2$。不需要“大样本协方差收敛”。\n\n采用论文二值设计 $J_{ST}=\mathbf1_{T\subseteq S}$，$Jw$ 是 subset sum，Möbius 反演给 $J$ 单射。于是非零 $u$ 满足 $u^\top J^\top Ju=\|Ju\|^2>0$；$2^n\operatorname{diag}(c)$ 半正定，包括 $\sigma=0$。$A=J^\top J+2^n\operatorname{diag}(c)$ 正定可逆。设 $u=A^{-1}J^\top y$，精确完成平方得到 $2^n(\widetilde L(w)-\widetilde L(u))=(w-u)^\top A(w-u)>0$（$w\ne u$），故 $u$ 是唯一全局最优解。\n\n标签按每一行是 $y_S=\sum_{T\subseteq S}w_T^*$，所以向量是 $y=Jw^*$；F.4 的 $J^\top w^*$ 仅是原证明转置错误。代入得到原 Theorem 3。原 Eq.(7) 的定义域问题单列，不靠它给零权重擅自补值。''',
r'''Under Assumption 1, the trigger noise is independent, centered, and has $c_T=2^{|T|}\sigma^2$. Expand each masked squared residual: cross expectations vanish and $E[(\sum_Tw_T\epsilon_T)^2]=\sum_Tc_Tw_T^2$. Thus $2^n\widetilde L(w)=\|y-Jw\|^2+2^n\sum_Tc_Tw_T^2$ exactly; no large-sample covariance limit is needed.\n\nFor the source binary design $J_{ST}=\mathbf1_{T\subseteq S}$, $Jw$ is the subset-sum operator and Möbius inversion proves injectivity. Hence $u^\top J^\top Ju=\|Ju\|^2>0$ for nonzero $u$. The nonnegative diagonal penalty is positive semidefinite even at $\sigma=0$, so $A$ is positive definite and invertible. For $u=A^{-1}J^\top y$, completing the square gives $2^n(\widetilde L(w)-\widetilde L(u))=(w-u)^\top A(w-u)>0$ when $w\ne u$, proving unique global minimality.\n\nRowwise labels satisfy $y_S=\sum_{T\subseteq S}w_T^*$, so $y=Jw^*$; F.4 prints the erroneous transpose. Substitution proves the original Theorem 3. The domain issue in Eq.(7) remains separate, without assigning unrequested values to zero weights.''',key='dyn-regression')
row('dyn-binary-trigger','Lemma 2: binary masked triggering',r'\forall S\subseteq N,\quad J_T(x_S)=\mathbf1_{T\subseteq S}',
D['dyn-trigger-representation'][4],D['dyn-trigger-representation'][5],key='dyn-binary-trigger',role='partial_proof')
row('dyn-equal-order','Theorem 4: equal norms at equal orders',r'|T|=|T\prime|\Longrightarrow\|\hat m_T\|_2=\|\hat m_{T\prime}\|_2',
r'''在二值设计的既定回归模型中取变量排列 $p$，它诱导幂集排列 $P$。因包含关系不变，$PJP^{-1}=J$，故 $PBP^{-1}=B$，$B=J^\top J$。噪声对角 $D_{TT}=2^{n+|T|}\sigma^2$ 只依赖阶数，故 $PDP^{-1}=D$。\n\n$A=B+D$ 已证可逆；$A\hat M=B$。将整个等式共轭给 $A(P\hat MP^{-1})=B$，解唯一推出 $P\hat MP^{-1}=\hat M$。若 $|T|=|T'|$，在有限总体上把 $T$ 到 $T'$ 的双射与补集双射合起来得到变量排列。上述矩阵等式把第 $T$ 行映为第 $T'$ 行并同时排列列，故平方和与二范数保持。该证明在 $\sigma=0$ 同样成立。''',
r'''In the fixed binary regression model, a variable permutation $p$ induces a powerset permutation $P$. Inclusion is preserved, hence $PJP^{-1}=J$ and $PBP^{-1}=B$ for $B=J^\top J$. The noise diagonal $D_{TT}=2^{n+|T|}\sigma^2$ depends only on order, so $PDP^{-1}=D$.\n\nInvertibility of $A=B+D$ has already been proved. Conjugating the full equation $A\hat M=B$ yields $A(P\hat MP^{-1})=B$, and uniqueness gives $P\hat MP^{-1}=\hat M$. If $|T|=|T'|$, combine bijections between these finite sets and their complements to obtain a variable permutation. The matrix identity carries one row to the other while permuting columns, preserving squared sums and Euclidean norms. This includes $\sigma=0$.''',key='dyn-equal-order')
row('dyn-order-monotonic','Proposition 1: order ratios and the zero-noise boundary',r'|T|<|T\prime|\Longrightarrow\|\hat m_T\|_2/\|\hat m_{T\prime}\|_2>1;\quad\text{ratio decreases with decreasing }\sigma^2',
r'''严格 $>1$ 子句没有排除 $\sigma=0$。取任意至少一变量总体、零噪声，则 $\hat M=(J^\top J)^{-1}J^\top J=I$；每一行二范数为 $1$，任意阶数比为 $1$，直接反驳严格不等式。此反例不反驳同阶等范数或对 $w^*$ 的独立性。\n\n后者由 $\hat M$ 的定义及变量排列不变性直接证明：$\hat M$ 只依赖 $n,\sigma^2$ 与幂集设计；行范数在同阶轨道上恒定，因此只依赖阶数。正噪声的一般单调比未在论文提供证明；有限矩阵检查与图3仅能支持猜测，不构成全称证明。该有效子句持续作为形式化待办，不能用添加 $\sigma>0$ 偷换整个原命题。''',
r'''The strict $>1$ clause does not exclude $\sigma=0$. For any nonempty universe at zero noise, $\hat M=(J^\top J)^{-1}J^\top J=I$. Every row has norm one, so ratios across different orders equal one. This refutes strictness but not equal-order invariance or independence from $w^*$.\n\nThose latter clauses follow from the definition and permutation invariance: $\hat M$ depends only on $n,\sigma^2$ and the powerset design, and row norms are constant on equal-order orbits. A general positive-noise monotonicity proof is absent from the source; finite matrix checks and Figure 3 support it only empirically. The valid clause remains a formalization task, and adding $\sigma>0$ would not repair the original proposition unchanged.''',role='counterexample',source='正文 Proposition 1 原陈述如上；作者没有专门证明，只有 Figure 3 的数值验证与机制解释。')
row('dyn-zero-noise','Theorem 5: exact recovery at zero noise',r'\sigma=0\Longrightarrow\forall\varnothing\ne T\subseteq N,\quad\hat w_T=w_T^*',
r'''由共有证明，二值 $J$ 在有限总体上单射，方阵可逆，所以 $B=J^\top J$ 正定可逆。$\sigma=0$ 使对角惩罚为零，原最优公式变为 $B^{-1}Bw^*=w^*$。它还恢复空集权重 $w_\varnothing^*=b$，不需要输出基线为零。严格凸完成平方保证这是唯一最优，不只是一个驻点。''',
r'''The shared proof establishes injectivity of the finite binary design, hence invertibility of its square matrix and positive definiteness of $B=J^\top J$. At $\sigma=0$ the diagonal penalty vanishes, giving $B^{-1}Bw^*=w^*$. This also recovers the empty weight $w_\varnothing^*=b$ without a zero output baseline. Completing the square makes the optimum unique.''',key='dyn-zero-noise')
# BNN and Difficulty share source math after checking each formal appendix independently.
for i in ['bnn-taylor','diff-taylor']:
 row(i,'Support-grouped Taylor expansion',r'I(S\mid x\prime)=\sum_{\pi\in Q_S}U_{S,\pi}J(S,\pi\mid x\prime)',
 D['dyn-taylor'][4]+r' 原 $U_{S,\pi}$ 的 sign 因子随 $x\prime$ 定义，因此它不是跨正负区域固定的系数。这个定义本身可恢复单项式符号；后续把系数固定来分析扰动时须另核。',
 D['dyn-taylor'][5]+r' Source $U_{S,\pi}$ includes a sign factor depending on $x\prime$, so it is not a fixed coefficient across orthants. That definition can restore monomial signs; later analyses that freeze the coefficient under perturbation require a separate check.',key='taylor',role='counterexample')
for i in ['bnn-lowest','diff-moments']:
 row(i,'Lowest-order Gaussian moments and sign-crossing tails',r'E_\epsilon[J(S,\hat\pi\mid x+\epsilon)]=1,\quad\operatorname{Var}_\epsilon[J(S,\hat\pi\mid x+\epsilon)]=(1+(\sigma/\tau)^2)^{|S|}-1',
 r'''一维原触发为 $J=\operatorname{sign}(x+\epsilon-r)(x+\epsilon-r)/\tau=|1+\epsilon/\tau|$，取 $x-r=\tau>0,\sigma>0$。令 $Z=1+\epsilon/\tau$，$E[Z]=1$，且 Gaussian 密度在 $Z<0$ 上严格正。恒等式 $|Z|=Z+2(-Z)\mathbf1_{Z<0}$ 给 $E[J]=1+2E[(-Z)\mathbf1_{Z<0}]>1$。所以原精确均值子句错误；又 $J^2=Z^2$ 给 $\operatorname{Var}[J]=1+(\sigma/\tau)^2-E[J]^2<(\sigma/\tau)^2$，原方差也非精确等式。\n\n作者已明确小扰动下忽略越界尾部；这可解释近似建模，但不能把非零 Gaussian 尾部删去后仍称精确期望。共有概率证明针对不同的 signed affine 产品 $\prod_i(1+\delta_i\epsilon_i/\tau)$：原独立 Gaussian 经缩放有每项均值1、方差 $q=(\sigma/\tau)^2$，独立乘积公式给均值1、方差 $(1+q)^{|S|}-1$。该完整公式作为实际模型子结果，不替换原 absolute 触发。''',
 r'''In one dimension the source trigger is $J=\operatorname{sign}(x+\epsilon-r)(x+\epsilon-r)/\tau=|1+\epsilon/\tau|$ for $x-r=\tau>0$ and $\sigma>0$. Put $Z=1+\epsilon/\tau$. Then $E[Z]=1$ and its Gaussian density is strictly positive on $Z<0$. The identity $|Z|=Z+2(-Z)\mathbf1_{Z<0}$ gives $E[J]=1+2E[(-Z)\mathbf1_{Z<0}]>1$. Thus the exact mean clause is false. Also $J^2=Z^2$ implies $\operatorname{Var}[J]=1+(\sigma/\tau)^2-E[J]^2<(\sigma/\tau)^2$, refuting exact variance.\n\nThe authors explicitly ignore sign-crossing tails under small perturbations. That explains an approximation but cannot establish exact expectations for untruncated Gaussian noise. The shared probability proof concerns the different signed affine product $\prod_i(1+\delta_i\epsilon_i/\tau)$: independent Gaussian scaling gives factor mean one and variance $q=(\sigma/\tau)^2$, and the product formula gives mean one and variance $(1+q)^{|S|}-1$. This is a genuine model subresult, without replacing the source absolute trigger.''',key='lowest',role='counterexample')
row('bnn-general-moments','Theorem 2.3: general-degree moments',r'E[J(S,\pi\mid x+\epsilon)]=E[\prod_{i\in S}(1+\epsilon_i/\tau)^{\pi_i}],\quad\operatorname{Var}[J]=\operatorname{Var}[\prod_{i\in S}(1+\epsilon_i/\tau)^{\pi_i}]',
 r'''原 $J=\prod_i|1+\delta_i\epsilon_i/\tau|^{\pi_i}$，其中 $\delta_i=\operatorname{sign}(x_i-r_i)$。若所有 $\pi_i$ 都为偶数，逐项 $|z|^{\pi_i}=z^{\pi_i}$，Gaussian 对称性允许去掉固定 $\delta_i$，因此原两个矩等式确实成立。独立性进一步把第一矩写成 $\prod_iE[Z_i^{\pi_i}]$，第二矩写成 $\prod_iE[Z_i^{2\pi_i}]$，相减得到方差。\n\n原命题允许奇次数；单坐标 $\pi=1$ 就是最低阶反例，原均值与方差的精确等式失败。一般原触发的正确矩为 $E[J]=\prod_iE[|Z_i|^{\pi_i}]$ 和 $\operatorname{Var}[J]=\prod_iE[Z_i^{2\pi_i}]-\prod_iE[|Z_i|^{\pi_i}]^2$。这是反例分析中的原模型精确计算，不改原命题。共有声明验证真实独立产品矩；Gaussian 所有有限阶矩存在。''',
 r'''The source trigger is $J=\prod_i|1+\delta_i\epsilon_i/\tau|^{\pi_i}$ with fixed $\delta_i=\operatorname{sign}(x_i-r_i)$. If all degrees are even, $|z|^{\pi_i}=z^{\pi_i}$ pointwise; Gaussian symmetry removes each fixed sign, establishing both source moment identities. Independence gives first moment $\prod_iE[Z_i^{\pi_i}]$ and second moment $\prod_iE[Z_i^{2\pi_i}]$, whose difference yields the variance.\n\nOdd degrees are allowed by the statement. The single-coordinate degree-one case is the lowest-order counterexample, refuting its exact mean and variance equalities. The source model instead has $E[J]=\prod_iE[|Z_i|^{\pi_i}]$ and $\operatorname{Var}[J]=\prod_iE[Z_i^{2\pi_i}]-\prod_iE[|Z_i|^{\pi_i}]^2$. These are exact calculations of the original model in the counterexample analysis, without changing the proposition. Shared declarations verify actual independent-product moments; Gaussian variables have all finite moments.''',key='general',role='counterexample')
for i in ['bnn-product','diff-product']:
 row(i,'Independent product means and variances',r'E[\prod_iX_i]=\prod_iE[X_i],\quad\operatorname{Var}[\prod_iX_i]=\prod_i(E[X_i]^2+\operatorname{Var}[X_i])-\prod_iE[X_i]^2',
 r'''在原应用的有限阶 Gaussian 因子中，各一阶、二阶矩都有限。独立联合律等于边缘律的有限乘积；Fubini 使 $E[\prod_iX_i]=\prod_iE[X_i]$。独立性经平方可测映射仍保持，故 $E[(\prod_iX_i)^2]=\prod_iE[X_i^2]$。\n\n每个 $E[X_i^2]=\operatorname{Var}[X_i]+E[X_i]^2$，产品平方可积性由独立乘积测度中的平方积分有限得到。用 $\operatorname{Var}[Y]=E[Y^2]-E[Y]^2$ 和 $(\prod_iE[X_i])^2=\prod_iE[X_i]^2$ 即得到完整原公式；空产品为常数1，方差0。独立但无矩存在的任意随机变量不在原公式有定义的范围。''',
 r'''In the source application, finite-degree Gaussian factors have finite first and second moments. Independence identifies the joint law with the finite product of marginal laws, and Fubini gives $E[\prod_iX_i]=\prod_iE[X_i]$. Squaring is measurable and preserves independence, hence $E[(\prod_iX_i)^2]=\prod_iE[X_i^2]$.\n\nEach second moment is $\operatorname{Var}[X_i]+E[X_i]^2$, and product square-integrability follows from the finite independent product measure. Apply $\operatorname{Var}[Y]=E[Y^2]-E[Y]^2$ and distribute the squared product of means. The empty product is constant one with variance zero. Arbitrary independent variables without finite moments lie outside the domain of the displayed formula.''',key='product')
row('bnn-growth','Theorem 2.4: variance growth on nested supports',r'\frac{\operatorname{Var}[J(S\prime,\pi\prime)]}{\operatorname{Var}[J(S,\pi)]}>\prod_{i\in S\prime\setminus S}E[(1+\epsilon_i/\tau)^{\pi_i\prime}]^2\ge1',
 r'''在比值有定义的原 Gaussian 模型范围，取原 absolute 因子 $A=\prod_{i\in S}|Z_i|^{\pi_i}$、$B=\prod_{i\in S'\setminus S}|Z_i|^{\pi'_i}$，$Z_i\sim\mathcal N(1,q)$。互不相交坐标使 $A,B$ 独立。$S$ 非空、$q>0$ 时 $\operatorname{Var}[A]>0,\operatorname{Var}[B]>0$，且两者均值正。产品公式精确给 $\operatorname{Var}[AB]=\operatorname{Var}[A](E[B]^2+\operatorname{Var}[B])+E[A]^2\operatorname{Var}[B]$，除正分母得严格大于 $E[B]^2$。\n\n对正整数 $k$，Jensen 给 $E|Z|^k\ge|EZ|^k=1$，且 $E|Z|^k\ge E[Z^k]$；原 signed Gaussian 矩递推也给 $E[Z^k]\ge1$。因此 $E[B]^2\ge\prod_iE[Z_i^{\pi'_i}]^2\ge1$，原第一不等式在有定义的范围成立；均值比 $E[AB]/E[A]=E[B]$，第二比值等于 $E[B]/(\operatorname{Var}[AB]/\operatorname{Var}[A])<1/E[B]\le1/\prod_iE[Z_i^{\pi'_i}]\le1$。\n\n这用原 absolute 触发补正原证明依赖错误 Theorem 2.3 的步骤。$q=0$ 或 $S=\varnothing$ 时方差分母为零，原严格比值未定义；不新增正噪声前提后声称整个无条件原陈述成立。Gaussian folded-power 的 Jensen/严格正方差步骤仍需完整 Lean 适配。''',
 r'''Where the ratios in the source Gaussian model are defined, use the original absolute factors $A=\prod_{i\in S}|Z_i|^{\pi_i}$ and $B=\prod_{i\in S'\setminus S}|Z_i|^{\pi'_i}$ with $Z_i\sim\mathcal N(1,q)$. Disjoint coordinates make them independent. For nonempty $S$ and $q>0$, both variances are positive and both means are positive. The product formula gives $\operatorname{Var}[AB]=\operatorname{Var}[A](E[B]^2+\operatorname{Var}[B])+E[A]^2\operatorname{Var}[B]$, so division yields a strict lower bound $E[B]^2$.\n\nFor positive integer $k$, Jensen gives $E|Z|^k\ge|EZ|^k=1$, while $E|Z|^k\ge E[Z^k]$. The source signed-Gaussian recurrence gives $E[Z^k]\ge1$. Thus $E[B]^2\ge\prod_iE[Z_i^{\pi'_i}]^2\ge1$, proving the first bound on its original domain. The mean ratio is $E[B]$, so the second ratio is less than $1/E[B]\le1/\prod_iE[Z_i^{\pi'_i}]\le1$.\n\nThis repairs the proof using the actual absolute trigger, without depending on the false general moment replacement. At $q=0$ or empty $S$, the variance denominator is zero. The unconditional source claim is not declared proved after adding a positive-noise hypothesis. The folded-Gaussian Jensen and strict-variance adaptation remains to be fully encoded in Lean.''',key='bnn-growth',role='partial_proof')
row('bnn-regression','Theorem 2.5: optimal independent-feature weights',r'|U_S^*|\propto|E[C_S(x+\epsilon)]/\operatorname{Var}[C_S(x+\epsilon)]|',
 r'''在所有显示比值有定义时，令 $a_i=E[C_i]$、$d_i=\operatorname{Var}[C_i]>0$。独立且二阶矩有限给精确损失 $L(w)=(y-\sum_i a_iw_i)^2+\sum_i d_iw_i^2$。令 $t=\sum_i a_i^2/d_i\ge0$，候选 $u_i=\frac{y}{1+t}\frac{a_i}{d_i}$。求和得到 $\sum_i a_iu_i=yt/(1+t)$，故 $d_iu_i=a_i(y-\sum_j a_ju_j)$。\n\n对任意 $h=w-u$，展开损失并用这些逐坐标方程消掉线性项：$L(w)-L(u)=(\sum_i a_ih_i)^2+\sum_i d_ih_i^2\ge0$，$h\ne0$ 时严格大于零。因此唯一全局最优正是 $u$，所有 $|u_i|$ 共用比例系数 $|y/(1+t)|$，证明原有定义范围的比例。无需对两个可能同时为零的 determinant 相除。\n\n原文没有排除零方差/零标签/零均值，所以 Cramer 分式与后续两权重相除不总有定义；$C_1=C_2=1,y=1$ 时全部满足独立，所有 $w_1+w_2=1$ 都最优，但 $a_i/d_i$ 未定义。该边界单列，不能偷添 $d_i>0$ 后声称原全范围成立。''',
 r'''Where all displayed ratios are defined, put $a_i=E[C_i]$ and $d_i=\operatorname{Var}[C_i]>0$. Independence and finite second moments give the exact loss $L(w)=(y-\sum_i a_iw_i)^2+\sum_i d_iw_i^2$. Let $t=\sum_i a_i^2/d_i\ge0$ and $u_i=\frac{y}{1+t}\frac{a_i}{d_i}$. Summing gives $\sum_i a_iu_i=yt/(1+t)$ and hence $d_iu_i=a_i(y-\sum_j a_ju_j)$.\n\nFor $h=w-u$, expand and cancel the linear terms using these equations: $L(w)-L(u)=(\sum_i a_ih_i)^2+\sum_i d_ih_i^2\ge0$, strictly positive for nonzero $h$. This proves unique global minimality and the common proportionality factor $|y/(1+t)|$, avoiding division by two possibly zero determinants.\n\nThe source does not exclude zero variance, label or means. Constant independent features $C_1=C_2=1,y=1$ make every $w_1+w_2=1$ optimal, while $a_i/d_i$ is undefined. This boundary is recorded separately; a positive-variance theorem does not prove the full printed scope unchanged.''',key='bnn-regression',role='partial_proof')
row('bnn-scaling','Theorem 2.6: scaling bounds for mean/variance ratios',r'A_{min}\frac{|E[I]|}{\operatorname{Var}[I]}\le\frac{|E[C]|}{\operatorname{Var}[C]}\le A_{max}\frac{|E[I]|}{\operatorname{Var}[I]}',
 r'''原定义 $I=uC$。在两侧比值有定义的范围，$u\ne0$、$v=\operatorname{Var}[C]>0$。期望线性性和方差缩放给 $E[I]=uE[C]$、$\operatorname{Var}[I]=u^2v$，由 $u^2=|u|^2$ 化简得 $|E[C]|/v=|u|\,|E[I]|/\operatorname{Var}[I]$。\n\n后一个比例非负，乘上 $A_{min}\le|u|\le A_{max}$ 即得两界。$u=0$ 或 $v=0$ 的原分式没有通常实数含义；原 trigger 的 $U_S=0$ 也产生除零，独立列为定义域问题。该完整有定义范围证明不把 Lean 的除零为零当成作者数学约定。''',
 r'''The source defines $I=uC$. Where both ratios are defined, $u\ne0$ and $v=\operatorname{Var}[C]>0$. Expectation linearity and variance scaling give $E[I]=uE[C]$ and $\operatorname{Var}[I]=u^2v$. Using $u^2=|u|^2$ yields $|E[C]|/v=|u|\,|E[I]|/\operatorname{Var}[I]$.\n\nThe latter ratio is nonnegative. Multiplying $A_{min}\le|u|\le A_{max}$ proves both bounds. At $u=0$ or $v=0$, the source fractions have no ordinary real value; zero $U_S$ also affects its trigger definition. The complete proof on the defined domain does not treat Lean totalized division as the authors convention.''',key='bnn-scaling',role='partial_proof')
row('diff-binary','Theorem 4: masked concept activation',r'C_S(x_T)=\prod_{i\in S}A_i(x_T)=\mathbf1_{S\subseteq T}',
 r'''在原 $C_S$ 有定义且 $U_S\ne0$ 的范围，$S\nsubseteq T$ 时选 $j\in S\setminus T$，遮罩令第 $j$ 因子为零，而次数为正，所以每项 $J=0$，整个 $C_S=0$。原 Case 1 写 $S\subsetneq T$ 却选择 $S\setminus T$ 元素，是证明错误；同一结论用 $S\nsubseteq T$ 补正。\n\n若 $S\subseteq T$，每个保留坐标满足 $|x_i-r_i|=\tau$，故所有因子为1，$C_S(x_T)=\sum_\pi U_{S,\pi}/U_S$。原未遮罩样本也有同一因子1，所以分子就是 $U_S$；非零相除得1。掩码不会翻转保留坐标符号，此离散证明不依赖 Gaussian 的越界近似。零概念的分母问题保留，不能在全部集合范围默默赋值。''',
 r'''Where the printed $C_S$ is defined and $U_S\ne0$, if $S\nsubseteq T$ choose $j\in S\setminus T$. Its masked coordinate gives a zero factor with positive degree, so every term and $C_S$ vanish. The source Case 1 prints $S\subsetneq T$ but selects an element of $S\setminus T$; using $S\nsubseteq T$ repairs this proof of the same conclusion.\n\nIf $S\subseteq T$, every retained coordinate has $|x_i-r_i|=\tau$, so all factors equal one and $C_S(x_T)=\sum_\pi U_{S,\pi}/U_S$. The original unmasked sample has the same unit factors, identifying the numerator with $U_S$; nonzero division gives one. Retained mask coordinates never change sign, so this discrete proof does not use the Gaussian-tail approximation. Zero-concept denominators remain a separate domain issue.''',key='diff-binary',role='partial_proof')
row('diff-multiorder','Appendix G.4: multi-order interaction coefficients',r'I^{(m)}(i,j)=\sum_{l=0}^m\sum_{L\subseteq N\setminus\{i,j\},\,|L|=m}\frac{\binom{n-2}{m-l}}{\binom{n-2}{m}}I(L\cup\{i,j\})',
 r'''原最后式内层写 $|L|=m$，且分子把可选剩余数写作 $n-2$。精确反例取 $N=\{i,j,k,a,b\},m=2$，$g(S)=\mathbf1_{\{i,j,k\}\subseteq S}$。唯一非零交互为 $I(\{i,j,k\})=1$；三种大小2背景 $\{k,a\},\{k,b\},\{a,b\}$ 中前两种边际为1，最后为0，故真实 $I^{(2)}(i,j)=2/3$。原内层只考虑大小2的 $L$，全都没有对应非零交互，给0；即使把内层单独改为 $|L|=l$，原系数对 $l=1$ 给 $\binom31/\binom32=1$，仍不是2/3。\n\n有效关系原理可以同命题补全：先用 Möbius 重构得 $\Delta g_{\{i,j\}}(S)=\sum_{L\subseteq S}I(L\cup\{i,j\})$，双重求和交换后每个 $L$ 被大小 $m$ 的背景包含次数为 $\binom{n-2-|L|}{m-|L|}$，因为只可从 $N\setminus(\{i,j\}\cup L)$ 选择额外 $m-|L|$ 项。正确组合推导是该关系的证明修复；但原显示最后等式本身错误，另列反例，不直接改原等式。''',
 r'''The last source formula filters $|L|=m$ and its numerator counts $n-2$ available coordinates. Take $N=\{i,j,k,a,b\}$, $m=2$, and $g(S)=\mathbf1_{\{i,j,k\}\subseteq S}$. Its only nonzero dividend is $I(\{i,j,k\})=1$. The backgrounds $\{k,a\},\{k,b\},\{a,b\}$ have marginal values one, one and zero, so the true $I^{(2)}(i,j)=2/3$. The printed size-two filter includes no nonzero dividend and gives zero. Even correcting only the filter to $|L|=l$ leaves coefficient $\binom31/\binom32=1$ instead of $2/3$.\n\nThe valid conceptual relation follows from Möbius reconstruction: $\Delta g_{\{i,j\}}(S)=\sum_{L\subseteq S}I(L\cup\{i,j\})$. After exchanging finite sums, each $L$ is contained in $\binom{n-2-|L|}{m-|L|}$ backgrounds, since the extra coordinates must come from $N\setminus(\{i,j\}\cup L)$. This repairs the underlying derivation, while the original displayed final equality remains separately refuted.''',key='diff-multiorder',role='counterexample')
row('diff-regression','Appendix G.5: variance and optimal regression weights',r'|w_i|/|w_j|=|\mu_i/\sigma_i^2|/|\mu_j/\sigma_j^2|,\qquad |w_i|\propto|1/\sigma_i^2|',
 D['bnn-regression'][4]+r' 本文另有两个独立问题：原设 $f\sim\mathcal N(\mu,\Sigma^2)$ 却把 $\Sigma=\operatorname{diag}(\sigma_i^2)$，所以实际方差是 $\sigma_i^4$，而 Eq.(28) 用 $\sigma_i^2$。取 $\mu=(1,1),y=1,\sigma_1=1,\sigma_2=2$，原定义真实协方差 $(1,16)$，最优权重比16，Eq.(28) 给4。\n\n即便把 $\sigma_i^2$ 解释为实际方差，Step 3 去掉均值也不合法。取实际方差 $(1,1)$、均值 $(1,2)$、标签1，由完整最优解 $u=(1/6,1/3)$；两个逆方差相等而权重不等。原 Step 3 无共同均值条件，所以是错误子句。',
 D['bnn-regression'][5]+r' Two additional source issues are distinct. The paper sets $f\sim\mathcal N(\mu,\Sigma^2)$ but defines $\Sigma=\operatorname{diag}(\sigma_i^2)$, giving actual variances $\sigma_i^4$, whereas Eq.(28) uses $\sigma_i^2$. With $\mu=(1,1)$, label one, and $\sigma=(1,2)$, the actual covariance is $(1,16)$; the optimum ratio is 16, while Eq.(28) gives four.\n\nEven interpreting $\sigma_i^2$ as actual variances does not justify dropping the means in Step 3. For variances $(1,1)$, means $(1,2)$ and label one, the optimum is $(1/6,1/3)$. Inverse variances agree but weights do not. No equal-mean condition is supplied, so Step 3 is a false clause.',key='diff-regression',role='counterexample')
# Independently searchable Appendix A axioms.
axioms=[
('dyn-efficiency','Efficiency',r'v(x)=\sum_{S\subseteq N}I_{and}(S\mid x)',r'将完整有限 Möbius 反演用于 $N$，给 $g(N)=\sum_{S\subseteq N}I_g(S)$。空集交互为 $b$，所以此和已经含基线，不能再加一次。',r'Apply finite Möbius inversion at $N$: $g(N)=\sum_{S\subseteq N}I_g(S)$. Its empty dividend is $b$, already counted in the sum.'),
('dyn-linearity','Linearity',r'g=g_1+g_2\Longrightarrow I_g(S)=I_{g_1}(S)+I_{g_2}(S)',r'在交互有限求和中展开 $g_1(T)+g_2(T)$，分配每个符号并分开两和。该操作不需要零基线；空项也按相同线性律相加。',r'Expand $g_1(T)+g_2(T)$ inside the finite dividend sum, distribute each sign and split the sums. No zero-baseline assumption is needed, including the empty term.'),
('dyn-dummy','Dummy',r'\forall U\subseteq N\setminus\{i\},g(U\cup\{i\})=g(U)+g(\{i\})\Longrightarrow\forall\varnothing\ne S\subseteq N\setminus\{i\},I_g(S\cup\{i\})=0',r'对固定非空 $S$，按是否含 $i$ 配对子集，得 $I_g(S\cup\{i\})=I_{h_i}(S)$，$h_i(U)=g(U\cup\{i\})-g(U)$。原 dummy 条件让 $h_i$ 在全部 $U\subseteq S$ 上等于常数 $g(\{i\})$。非空集合上的常数交互为零，故结论成立。原条件取 $U=\varnothing$ 还强制 $g(\varnothing)=0$；这是原假设的推论，不是默认基线为零。',r'Pair subsets according to whether they contain $i$, giving $I_g(S\cup\{i\})=I_{h_i}(S)$ with $h_i(U)=g(U\cup\{i\})-g(U)$. The source dummy premise makes $h_i$ constant on every $U\subseteq S$. A constant game has zero nonempty dividends. The source premise at $U=\varnothing$ also forces $g(\varnothing)=0$; this is a consequence of that premise, not a default convention.'),
('dyn-symmetry','Symmetry',r'\forall U\subseteq N\setminus\{i,j\},g(U\cup\{i\})=g(U\cup\{j\})\Longrightarrow I_g(S\cup\{i\})=I_g(S\cup\{j\})',r'原作用域 $S\subseteq N\setminus\{i,j\}$。$i=j$ 时结论自反；否则按插入变量的交互差分公式，两边分别是 $I_{h_i}(S)$ 与 $I_{h_j}(S)$。对全部 $U\subseteq S$，背景项 $g(U)$ 相同，原对称前提令插入输出相等，所以边际函数在相关幂集一致；有限交互求和逐项相等。',r'The source scope is $S\subseteq N\setminus\{i,j\}$. If $i=j$ the conclusion is reflexive. Otherwise the insertion-difference identity writes both sides as $I_{h_i}(S)$ and $I_{h_j}(S)$. On every $U\subseteq S$, background $g(U)$ agrees and the source symmetry premise identifies the inserted outputs. The marginal games therefore agree termwise in the dividend sum.'),
('dyn-anonymity','Anonymity',r'I_g(S)=I_{\pi g}(\pi S),\quad(\pi g)(\pi U)=g(U)',r'变量排列是有限总体的双射，诱导 $U\subseteq S$ 与 $\pi U\subseteq\pi S$ 的双射。其保持集合基数、包含关系与原模型值，因此交互和每项符号 $(-1)^{|S|-|U|}$ 保持。以该双射换元得原等式。',r'A variable permutation induces a bijection between $U\subseteq S$ and $\pi U\subseteq\pi S$, preserving cardinalities, inclusion and model values. Each sign is preserved, so changing variables in the finite sum proves the source equality.'),
('dyn-recursion','Recursive interaction',r'I_g(S\cup\{i\})=I_{U\mapsto g(U\cup\{i\})}(S)-I_g(S),\quad i\notin S',r'把 $S\cup\{i\}$ 的子集分成 $U$ 与 $U\cup\{i\}$，$U\subseteq S$。不含 $i$ 的符号比含 $i$ 的多一个负号；两项配对得 $\sum_{U\subseteq S}(-1)^{|S|-|U|}[g(U\cup\{i\})-g(U)]$，线性拆和即所需背景存在/缺席差。',r'Partition subsets into $U$ and $U\cup\{i\}$ for $U\subseteq S$. The absent-$i$ sign is the negative of the present-$i$ sign. Pairing yields $\sum_{U\subseteq S}(-1)^{|S|-|U|}[g(U\cup\{i\})-g(U)]$; linearity gives the difference between the present-context and absent-context dividends.'),
('dyn-distribution','Interaction distribution',r'g_A(S)=c\mathbf1_{A\subseteq S}\Longrightarrow I_{g_A}(S)=c\mathbf1_{S=A}',r'定义唯一系数 $d(A)=c$、其余为零，subset sum 为 $\sum_{T\subseteq S}d(T)=c\mathbf1_{A\subseteq S}=g_A(S)$。Möbius 逆变换或唯一性推出 $I_{g_A}=d$。允许 $A=\varnothing$：此时模型常数，全部基线在空项。',r'Let $d(A)=c$ and all other coefficients be zero. Its subset sum is $c\mathbf1_{A\subseteq S}=g_A(S)$. Möbius inversion or uniqueness identifies $I_{g_A}=d$. If $A=\varnothing$, the game is constant and its baseline resides solely in the empty term.')]
for i,title,tex,z,e in axioms:row(i,'Appendix A: '+title,tex,z,e,source='Appendix A 原性质：$'+tex+'$。本篇未附单独作者证明；公共有限集合理论的完整项目证明在下方。')
row('dyn-uniqueness','Appendix D: unique reconstruction coefficients',r'\forall S,\ g(S)=\sum_{T\subseteq S}d(T)\Longrightarrow d=I_g',r'对原全部掩码重构式取 Möbius 变换。互逆性给 $I_{\operatorname{reconstruct}d}(S)=d(S)$；原式把左边函数替成 $g$，所以 $d(S)=I_g(S)$。这证明给定固定游戏的 AND 交互唯一；它不意味着 AND/OR 联合任意拆分的参数 $\gamma$ 唯一。',r'Apply the Möbius transform to the source reconstruction identity at every mask. Inversion gives $I_{\operatorname{reconstruct}d}(S)=d(S)$, while the premise identifies the reconstructed game with $g$. Thus $d(S)=I_g(S)$. This proves uniqueness of AND dividends for one fixed game, not uniqueness of an arbitrary joint AND/OR split.',source='Appendix D 引用 [13]/[23] 称符号系数唯一保证 universal matching；此篇没有另给证明。')
row('dyn-interaction-definition','AND/OR split and dividend definitions',r'a(S)=\tfrac12g(S)+\gamma_S,\quad o(S)=\tfrac12g(S)-\gamma_S,\quad A(T)=\sum_{L\subseteq T}(-1)^{|T|-|L|}a(L),\quad O(T)=-\sum_{L\subseteq T}(-1)^{|T|-|L|}o(N\setminus L)',r'原 $I_{and},I_{or}$ 是分量游戏的变换，规范局部写 $A,O$；总输出游戏 $g$ 的交互 $I_g$ 并非默认等于 $A$。原 Eq.(2) 只对非空 $T$ 定义 OR；F.1 另规定 $a(\varnothing)=b,o(\varnothing)=0$，故 $\gamma_\varnothing=b/2$。空基线必须按这项约束处理。',r'Source $I_{and},I_{or}$ transform the component games, denoted locally by $A,O$; the total-game dividend $I_g$ is not automatically $A$. Eq.(2) defines OR only for nonempty $T$. F.1 separately imposes $a(\varnothing)=b,o(\varnothing)=0$, hence $\gamma_\varnothing=b/2$. The empty baseline must follow this constraint.',role='definition')
row('dyn-complement','Appendix E: OR as a complement AND transform',r'I_{or}(S\mid x)=-\sum_{T\subseteq S}(-1)^{|S|-|T|}v(x_{N\setminus T})=-I_{and}(S\mid\tilde x)',r'原反向遮罩坐标是 $(\tilde x_T)_i=x_i$（$i\notin T$）、$b_i$（$i\in T$），所以逐坐标 $\tilde x_T=x_{N\setminus T}$。将相同分量函数作用到该等式，OR 的负 Möbius 和就是反向游戏的负 AND 交互。\n\nAppendix E 临时设两个分量为总模型的一半来解释；这不能自动证明任意学习分量满足外引稀疏性定理的三条件，也不把原 OR 系数的负号抹掉。本文 Eq.(16) 原式确为负号。',r'The source reversed mask retains $x_i$ for $i\notin T$ and uses $b_i$ for $i\in T$, so $\tilde x_T=x_{N\setminus T}$ coordinatewise. Applying the same component function identifies the negative OR Möbius sum with a negative AND dividend of the reversed game.\n\nAppendix E temporarily sets both components to half the total model for illustration. This does not verify the three external sparsity assumptions for arbitrary learned components, and the negative sign in Eq.(16) remains.',source=r'原 Eq.(12) $(x_T)_i=x_i$ if $i\in T$, else $b_i$；Eq.(13) $(\tilde x_T)_i=x_i$ if $i\notin T$, else $b_i$。Eq.(14) $I_{or}=-\sum_{T\subseteq S}(-1)^{|S|-|T|}v(x_{N\setminus T})$，Eq.(15) 换成 $v(\tilde x_T)$，Eq.(16) 得 $-I_{and}(S\mid\tilde x)$。')
row('dyn-sparsity','Theorem 1: cited sparsity under three conditions',r'|\Omega|=O(n^\xi/\tau),\quad\Omega=\{S\subseteq N:|I_{and}(S\mid x)|\ge\tau\}',r'本篇引用 [27] 的定理而不重证；Appendix B 明确最高交互阶数、平均遮罩输出单调和多项式退化界三个前提。三个条件分别列独立入口，不能把“相对稳定”概述替代其量词。\n\n该结论关于特定游戏与阈值，$\xi\in[1.9,2.2]$ 是经验范围而非证明条件。AND/OR 补集恒等式不自动传递对两个学习分量的三条件；本篇关于 OR 稀疏的外推须单独核查。共享 Sparse 理论可查询具体条件，但本条未伪造已完成原渐近命题的 Lean 适配。',r'This paper cites [27] rather than reproving the theorem. Appendix B explicitly lists a maximum interaction order, monotone mean masked outputs and a polynomial degradation bound; each condition has its own searchable entry. The phrase relatively stable does not replace their quantifiers.\n\nThe bound concerns a specific game and threshold. The range $\xi\in[1.9,2.2]$ is empirical. Complement duality does not establish the three assumptions for both learned components, so the OR sparsity extension requires a separate check. The shared Sparse theory exposes its precise conditions, while this entry does not fabricate a completed Lean adaptation of the asymptotic source claim.',role='scope_analysis',source='原 Theorem 1 如上，正文脚注7说明三个条件，Appendix B 全文分别列 Condition 1–3。原文没有本地证明。')
for i,title,tex,z,e in [
('dyn-cutoff','B Condition 1: order cutoff',r'\forall S\subseteq N,\quad |S|\ge M+1\Longrightarrow I_{and}(S\mid x)=0',r'该条件以明确整数最高阶数 $M$ 排除更高交互。它是外引稀疏证明的假设，不是本文从任意 DNN 推出的定理。不能把经验上高阶较少等同于严格零截断。',r'This assumption excludes dividends above the specified integer maximum order $M$. It is a premise of the cited sparsity theory, not a theorem about every DNN. Empirically small high-order effects do not imply exact truncation.'),
('dyn-mask-monotonic','B Condition 2: monotone mask average',r'\bar u^{(k)}=E_{|S|=k}[v(x_S)-v(x_\varnothing)],\quad k\prime\le k\Longrightarrow\bar u^{(k\prime)}\le\bar u^{(k)}',r'平均在总体大小 $k$ 的全部遮罩上均匀取值，先中心化减去输出基线。这是阶数平均的单调条件，不要求每一个遮罩对每个插入变量单调。$k=0$ 时中心化平均为零。',r'The expectation is uniform over all masks of size $k$, after subtracting the output baseline. Monotonicity of these averages does not require each individual mask to be monotone under insertion. The centered average at $k=0$ is zero.'),
('dyn-mask-polynomial','B Condition 3: polynomial mask bound',r'\bar u^{(k\prime)}\ge(k\prime/k)^p\bar u^{(k)},\quad k\prime\le k,\ p>0',r'原比例对 $k=0$ 未定义；在 $1\le k\le n,0\le k\prime\le k$ 的有定义范围读取原条件，$p>0$ 为固定常数。它约束平均输出退化速度而非交互系数的逐项符号。原空分母边界需明示，不通过 Lean 除零约定扩充作者条件。',r'The printed ratio is undefined at $k=0$. Read the source condition on its defined domain $1\le k\le n,0\le k\prime\le k$, with fixed $p>0$. It controls average-output degradation, not individual dividend signs. The zero-denominator boundary is recorded explicitly without importing Lean totalized division.')]:row(i,title,tex,z,e,role='definition')
row('dyn-regression-definition','Masked regression and Assumption 1',r'L(w)=E_{S\subseteq N}(y_S-w^\top J(x_S))^2,\quad\widetilde L(w)=E_\epsilon E_{S\subseteq N}(y_S-w^\top(J(x_S)+\epsilon))^2,\quad\operatorname{Var}(\epsilon_T)=2^{|T|}\sigma^2',r'原 $S$ 均匀遍历所有 $2^n$ 个遮罩，$w,J,y$ 都包括空集坐标，$J_\varnothing=1,w_\varnothing=b$。Assumption 1 另明确各触发噪声独立，重设方差为 $2^{|T|}\sigma^2$。该假设不是 Lemma 1 自然产生的交互噪声联合律，因为不同交互通常共用输出噪声而相关。',r'The source averages uniformly over all $2^n$ masks. Vectors $w,J,y$ include the empty coordinate, with $J_\varnothing=1,w_\varnothing=b$. Assumption 1 separately imposes independent trigger noises and variance $2^{|T|}\sigma^2$. This is not the joint law automatically generated by Lemma 1, since dividends generally share and correlate through output noises.',role='definition')
row('dyn-first-phase','First-phase mechanism under the regression model',r'\text{First phase: initial random interactions approach the large-noise optimum}',r'原 Section 3.3.3 把训练过程解释为大噪声水平下朝最优解移动，而第二阶段解释为噪声下降时最优解的改变。已证回归最优公式说明静态目标，不单独规定 SGD 轨迹、噪声下降律或 epoch 与 $\sigma$ 的关系，所以无法从该公式直接证明任意 DNN 的动态。\n\n对固定正定二次目标，梯度下降若步长满足 $0<\eta<1/\lambda_{max}(A)$，误差递推为 $h_{t+1}=(I-2\eta A)h_t$，可证明收敛。但作者未把该更新律/步长作为原 DNN 训练假设，因此这是另一个条件模型而非原第一阶段的完整形式化。',r'Section 3.3.3 interprets the first phase as approaching the large-noise optimum and the second as movement of that optimum as noise declines. The proven regression formula is static; it specifies neither an SGD trajectory, a noise schedule nor a relation between epoch and $\sigma$. It therefore does not directly prove dynamics for every DNN.\n\nFor a fixed positive-definite quadratic, gradient descent with $0<\eta<1/\lambda_{max}(A)$ obeys $h_{t+1}=(I-2\eta A)h_t$ and converges. That update and step-size premise are absent from the source DNN claim, so this is a separate conditional model.',role='scope_analysis',source='原 Section 3.3.3 的完整机制论证是：随机初始化 spindle 分布已由[41]证明；第一阶段去掉混乱初始化交互并趋近大噪声 Eq.(9) 最优解；第二阶段为噪声下降时最优解的变化。Appendix H/I 讨论理想互动与假设，没有新的训练轨迹定理。')
for i in ['bnn-interaction','diff-universal']:
 row(i,'Exact masked reconstruction and salient approximation',r'g(T)=\sum_{S\subseteq T}I_g(S)\approx\sum_{S\in\Omega_{salient},S\subseteq T}I_g(S)',r'精确部分由共有有限 Möbius 反演给出，$I_g(\varnothing)=b$，因此包括全部 $S\subseteq T$ 时不再另加输出基线。\n\n选定显著支持后的残差是 $R(T)=\sum_{S\subseteq T,S\notin\Omega_{salient}}I_g(S)$，所以 $|R(T)|\le\sum_{S\subseteq T,S\notin\Omega_{salient}}|I_g(S)|$。这是精确尾和界；原“近似”没有指定统一误差或仅凭逐项阈值证明小总误差。若所有遗漏项 $|I_g(S)|<\tau$，有保守界 $|R(T)|<(\#\text{遗漏项})\tau$，指数多的小项仍可能累积。',r'The exact part follows from shared finite Möbius inversion, with $I_g(\varnothing)=b$ already included.\n\nFor a selected salient family, the residual is $R(T)=\sum_{S\subseteq T,S\notin\Omega_{salient}}I_g(S)$, giving $|R(T)|\le\sum_{S\subseteq T,S\notin\Omega_{salient}}|I_g(S)|$. This is an exact tail bound; the source approximation specifies no uniform error. If every omitted term has magnitude below $\tau$, a conservative bound is the number of omitted terms times $\tau$. Exponentially many small terms can still accumulate.',role='partial_proof',source='正文原陈述：$'+r'g(T)=\sum_{S\subseteq T}I_g(S)\approx\sum_{S\in\Omega_{salient},S\subseteq T}I_g(S)'+'$。精确重构为外引，近似与稀疏主要经验验证。')
row('diff-interaction','Harsanyi dividend definition',r'I(S\mid x)=\sum_{T\subseteq S}(-1)^{|S|-|T|}v(x_T)',r'原式是固定输入与基线的有限集合变换，空项等于 $v(x_\varnothing)=b$；单变量项等于 $v(x_{\{i\}})-b$。概念复杂度为 $|S|$。原总模型与任何固定掩码后的限制游戏需区分，不能把不同输入的交互强行当同一系数。',r'The source expression is a finite transform at fixed input and baseline. Its empty term is $v(x_\varnothing)=b$, and a singleton term is $v(x_{\{i\}})-b$. Concept complexity is $|S|$. The original game and a further restricted masked game have different scopes; dividends at different inputs are not silently identical.',role='definition')
for i in ['bnn-sparsity','diff-sparsity']:
 row(i,'Cited emergence, transferability and discrimination',r'\Omega_{salient}=\{S:|I(S\mid x)|\text{ is salient}\},\quad|\Omega_{salient}|\ll2^n',r'原“concept emergence”引用有限重构与经条件定理支持的稀疏性，并给经验图检验；Appendix B/F 讨论相关工作或显著系数直方图，没有本地新的稀疏证明。转移性指同一交互在同类样本反复提取，辨别性指对相同类别同方向贡献，这两项也是外引经验观察。\n\n三项分别作为本条可检索子声明：(1) 少量显著交互，(2) 跨样本 transferability，(3) 类别 discrimination。不能从任意有限游戏的可重构性推出前两项或辨别性。反例式密集游戏可由给每个非空集合系数1并重构产生；所有 $2^n-1$ 项都显著。',r'The source cites exact reconstruction and a conditional sparsity theory, with empirical figures; Appendix B/F discusses related work or coefficient histograms rather than proving a new sparsity theorem. Transferability means repeated extraction of the same interaction from same-class samples, and discrimination means consistent contribution toward the same category; both are cited empirical observations.\n\nThe three searchable subclaims are: few salient dividends, cross-sample transferability, and category discrimination. Reconstruction of arbitrary finite games proves none of these automatically. A dense game is obtained by assigning coefficient one to every nonempty coalition and reconstructing it; all $2^n-1$ terms are salient.',role='scope_analysis',source='原文称稀疏概念由相关工作证明/观察，transferability 与 discrimination 由 Li & Zhang 工作发现；本篇没有局部证明。')
for i in ['bnn-reference','diff-reference']:
 row(i,'Baseline distance and small-perturbation convention',r'r_i=x_i-\tau\ (x_i>\mu_i),\quad r_i=x_i+\tau\ (x_i\le\mu_i),\quad\epsilon\sim\mathcal N(0,\sigma^2I)',r'原输入基线朝数据均值 $\mu_i$ 移动距离 $\tau$。Footnote 的 over-perturbation 裁剪可能使实际距离小于 $\tau$；后续理论明确忽略此裁剪。于是理论近似采用 $x_i-r_i\in\{-\tau,\tau\}$。\n\n“Gaussian 方差小”与“绝对不越过基线”不等价；非退化 Gaussian 具有无界支持。若条件化为 $|\epsilon_i|<\tau$，则分布不再是原未截断 Gaussian，方差也变化；若仅忽略尾部，结论是近似，须另给误差界。原文未给这类误差界。',r'The input baseline moves distance $\tau$ toward the data mean $\mu_i$. The over-perturbation clipping in a footnote can shorten that distance; the subsequent analysis explicitly ignores it and uses $x_i-r_i\in\{-\tau,\tau\}$.\n\nSmall Gaussian variance does not guarantee that a coordinate never crosses its baseline: nondegenerate Gaussian support is unbounded. Conditioning on $|\epsilon_i|<\tau$ changes the law and variance. Ignoring tails produces an approximation requiring a separate error bound, which the source does not provide.',role='definition')
for i in ['bnn-trigger','diff-trigger-definition']:
 row(i,'Normalized concept trigger',r'I(S\mid x\prime)=U_SC_S(x\prime),\quad U_S=I(S\mid x),\quad C_S(x\prime)=\sum_{\pi\in Q_S}U_{S,\pi}J(S,\pi\mid x\prime)/U_S',r'原常数 $U_S$ 固定于参考样本 $x$，原 $C_S$ 用支持展开的贡献归一化；不等于 Harsanyi 权重本身。$U_S\ne0$ 的有定义范围直接给 $I=U_SC_S$。遮罩状态的二值结论另有证明（BNN正文Eq.(13)，Difficulty Theorem4），对一般连续变换输入触发是实数。\n\n$U_S=0$ 的概念不能按通常实数定义该比值；若将概念限制为严格非零显著支持，应保存该作用域，不能对所有 $S\subseteq N$ 宣称同一函数都有定义。',r'The constant $U_S$ is fixed at the reference sample $x$, while $C_S$ normalizes the support-grouped contribution and is not the dividend weight itself. Where $U_S\ne0$, the definition gives $I=U_SC_S$. Binary masking is proved separately (BNN Eq.(13), Difficulty Theorem 4); on continuously transformed inputs the trigger is real-valued.\n\nZero-effect concepts do not define this ordinary real ratio. Restricting to a strictly nonzero salient support must be recorded explicitly rather than claiming the same function exists for every $S\subseteq N$.',role='definition')
row('bnn-objective','Surrogate concept regression objective',r'L(U)=E_\epsilon[(y^*-\sum_{S\in\Omega}U_SC_S(x+\epsilon))^2]',r'原训练 BNN 到噪声替代 DNN 是近似模型，$x,y^*$ 固定、只在扰动上取期望，特征 $C_S$ 被视为固定随机函数而系数 $U_S$ 为优化变量。若 $C_S$ 自身依赖正在训练的权重，此固定特征模型不直接等于原神经网络优化。独立性另在 Theorem2.5 假设，不由不同概念“通常重叠少”逻辑推出。',r'The BNN-to-noisy-surrogate connection is an approximation. Here $x,y^*$ are fixed, expectation is only over perturbations, each $C_S$ is a fixed random feature, and $U_S$ is optimized. If triggers themselves change with trained network weights, this fixed-feature model is not automatically the original network objective. Independence is separately assumed in Theorem 2.5 and does not follow logically from usually small overlap.',role='definition')
row('bnn-posterior','Mean-field variational BNN and surrogate',r'q_\theta(W)=\prod_i\mathcal N(w_i;\mu_i,\sigma_i^2),\quad\min_\theta E_{q_\theta(W)}[-\log p(D\mid W)]+\operatorname{KL}(q_\theta(W)\|p(W)),\quad p(y\mid x)=E_{W\sim q_\theta}[p(y\mid x,W)]',r'原均场变分假设把网络参数的近似后验分解为独立 Gaussian。训练优化分类负对数似然加 KL，测试平均多个参数采样网络的分类概率。原替代模型只给中间特征加匹配噪声来逼近这些分布；这是经验近似而不是权重噪声等同独立输入扰动的普遍定理。\n\n层上的均值 $\mu_i$ 和参数标准差 $\sigma_i$ 不同于固定样本的输入基线 $r_i$、数据均值、输出标量基线 $b$；按作用域分开符号。',r'The mean-field variational assumption factorizes the approximate parameter posterior into independent Gaussian laws. Training combines classification negative log-likelihood with KL divergence; testing averages class probabilities over sampled networks. The surrogate injects matched noise into intermediate features to approximate these distributions. This is an empirical approximation, not a universal equality between weight noise and independent input perturbations.\n\nParameter means and deviations are distinct from input baselines, data means and scalar output baseline $b$, and retain separate symbol scopes.',role='definition')
row('bnn-generalization','Appendix F: concept generalization ratio',r'r^{(m)}=E_{x\in X_{train}}[E_{x\prime\in X_{test}}[\text{comparison of }m\text{-order effects}]]',r'Appendix F 区分训练样本的典型交互与测试样本是否重新出现，并按阶数取平均形成经验 generalization 指标。它引用“高阶方差使泛化较弱”的研究解释，不提供由训练误差到任意测试分布的概率泛化界。原页13–14的比值与平均输入集合须逐式保留；零交互分母未规定。',r'Appendix F compares typical training-sample effects with their recurrence in testing samples and averages by order to define an empirical generalization metric. It cites the interpretation that high variance weakens generalization, without deriving a probabilistic bound from training loss to arbitrary test distributions. The source ratios and averaging families on pages 13–14 retain their local scopes; zero-effect denominators are unspecified.',role='definition')
row('bnn-metrics','Concept strength and perturbation metrics',r'V^{(s)}=E_xE_{|S|=s}[\operatorname{Var}_\epsilon I(S\mid x+\epsilon)],\quad K^{(s)}=E_xE_{|S|=s}[|E_\epsilon I|/\sqrt{\operatorname{Var}_\epsilon I}]',r'原指标分别按样本与同阶子集平均：绝对强度、扰动方差及均值除标准差的稳定度。Gaussian 输入扰动与采样 BNN 权重产生的扰动是不同随机模型，原 Figures 2–3 比较它们的经验趋势，不将测量相似性等同严格分布相同。零方差稳定度的分母需单独处理。',r'The source metrics average over samples and equal-order coalitions: absolute strength, perturbation variance, and mean divided by standard deviation. Input Gaussian perturbations and sampled BNN parameter perturbations are different random models. Figures 2–3 compare empirical trends without proving equality of distributions. Stability ratios at zero variance need a separate convention.',role='definition')
row('diff-training-metrics','Learning speed, structure similarity and concept strength',r'\operatorname{order}(S)=|S|,\quad\beta(S),\quad\operatorname{sim}(I_t,I_{final}),\quad A^{(s)}',r'原 Section2.3/3 分别衡量概念达到最终效果的速度、当前与最终交互向量结构的相似度，以及同阶概念平均绝对效果。训练时间索引 $t$ 与交互 Taylor 次数 $\pi$、阶数 $s=|S|$ 作用域不同。Appendix H 规定训练设置和阈值；这些指标是定义和经验观察，不能据曲线外推成任意优化器的理论收敛保证。',r'Sections 2.3/3 measure the rate at which concepts reach their final effects, similarity between current and final dividend vectors, and average absolute effect by order. Training index $t$, Taylor degree $\pi$ and concept order $s=|S|$ have different scopes. Appendix H supplies training settings and thresholds. These are definitions and empirical observations, not convergence guarantees for arbitrary optimizers.',role='definition')
row('dyn-salience','Salience threshold and normalized order strength',r'\tau=0.03E_x|v(x)-v(x_\varnothing)|,\quad I_{real}^{(k)}=E_x[\sum_{type\in\{and,or\}}\sum_{|S|=k,|I_{type}(S\mid x)|\ge\tau}|I_{type}(S\mid x)|]/Z',r'原阈值由总输出相对空遮罩的幅度决定，输出基线只用于中心化，不假设零。$Z$ 是各阶数平均的未归一化强度，使不同 epoch 可比较相对阶数分布；$Z=0$ 时原比值无定义。后续理论 $\hat w$ 采用另一阈值 $\tau_{theo}=0.03|v_{theo}(x)-\hat w_\varnothing|$，不可当同一个随机阈值。',r'The threshold uses output magnitude relative to the empty mask, without assuming a zero baseline. $Z$ averages unnormalized strength across orders to compare relative distributions between epochs; the ratio is undefined when $Z=0$. The theoretical weights use a distinct threshold $\tau_{theo}=0.03|v_{theo}(x)-\hat w_\varnothing|$, which is not silently identified with the empirical one.',role='definition')
row('dyn-extraction','Sparse split optimization and noise removal',r'\min_{\{\gamma_T\}}\sum_{S\subseteq N}(|I_{and}(S\mid x)|+|I_{or}(S\mid x)|),\quad\delta_T\in[-\zeta,\zeta],\quad\zeta=0.02|v(x)-v(x_\varnothing)|',r'对固定全部遮罩输出，用每个 $\gamma_T$ 定义双分量并最小化系数 L1 和；可另允许有界输出噪声 $\delta_T$。这是优化问题定义，不保证原神经网络自身编码稀疏，也不保证选解唯一。\n\nAppendix C 第一段把第二分量误标为 $v_{and}$；噪声移除段还把两分量都写 $+\gamma_T$，相加给 $v(x_T)-\delta_T+2\gamma_T$，不等于前述分解目标。原错式保存为 proof/definition equation issue；项目读取前述 Eq.(2) 的已规定分解，不静默修改原录文。',r'The fixed complete masked-output family is split using each $\gamma_T$ and optimized for an L1 sum of coefficients, optionally with bounded output perturbations $\delta_T$. This defines an optimization problem, without guaranteeing intrinsic network sparsity or unique selection.\n\nAppendix C mislabels the second component as $v_{and}$ and later prints $+\gamma_T$ in both noise-removal branches. Their sum is $v(x_T)-\delta_T+2\gamma_T$, contradicting the stated split. The source equations are retained as a definition/proof equation issue; the project uses the previously specified split without silently editing the transcription.',role='definition')
for i in ['dyn-experiments','bnn-experiments','diff-experiments']:
 row(i,'Empirical evidence and experimental scope',r'\text{Measured interaction distributions across networks, datasets, masks and perturbations}',r'本篇正文及实验附录的图、表和训练设置逐页纳入来源清单。它们测量固定网络或有限训练运行的概念复杂度、稀疏性、方差或学习趋势，提供实验支持。实验数据不能替代对任意 DNN、任意阶数或全部噪声水平的数学证明；没有专门 theorem 的图表保持经验条目。原 PDF 对应页面保存可查看证据。',r'The figures, tables and training settings in the main text and experimental appendices are included page by page. They measure concept complexity, sparsity, variance or learning trends in fixed networks and finite training runs. Experiments support interpretations but do not prove claims for arbitrary DNNs, all orders or all noise levels. Figures without a theorem remain empirical entries; the official PDF pages remain available.',role='empirical')

row('dyn-transferability','Transferability across samples',r'\text{Salient interactions extracted from one input can usually also be extracted from other inputs}',r'原转移性性质说一个输入提取的显著交互通常在其他输入也出现，引用[21]在多网络任务的观察，没有对任意样本或分布的数学量词和本地证明。固定输入的有限重构不涉及其他输入，因此不能推出该经验性质。应先另定义跨输入坐标对应、显著阈值和样本分布，才可陈述概率版本；本项目没有擅自补这些原未给参数。',r'The source says salient interactions from one input can usually be extracted from others, citing observations in [21]. It provides no universal sample/distribution quantifier or local proof. Finite reconstruction at one input says nothing about other inputs and does not imply this property. A probabilistic version would require cross-input coordinate correspondence, thresholds and a sample distribution, which are not silently supplied here.',role='scope_analysis',source='原文完整数学性陈述：显著交互从一个输入样本提取，通常也能从其他输入提取；若如此称跨样本可转移。该性质在多种DNN任务广泛观察[21]。')
row('dyn-discrimination','Discrimination across categories',r'\text{The same interaction across samples consistently contributes to one category}',r'原辨别性性质说不同样本的同一交互持续对某类别分类作贡献，引用[21]观察。模型分数已选指定类别；交互的类别方向是局部解释，而“持续”还涉及跨样本统计。没有单独局部证明，也不能把任意实值游戏重构解释成跨类别辨别定理。',r'The source says the same interaction across different samples consistently contributes to a particular category, citing [21]. The model score is for a chosen category; the contribution direction is local while consistency concerns sample statistics. There is no separate local proof, and arbitrary real-game reconstruction is not a cross-category discrimination theorem.',role='scope_analysis',source='原文完整数学性陈述：不同样本提取的同一交互持续贡献到某类别分类；该性质在各种DNN观察[21]，说明交互可用于分类辨别。')
